{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And on the seventh day He ceased.</b> On it the work was complete, and in perfection there comes rest." "<b>And He rested.</b> Therefore the seventh day was endowed with an added measure of soul — namely, an additional disposition to attain that which the blessed El aimed at in the perfection of His work, when He said: נַעֲשֶׂה אָדָם בְּצַלְמֵנוּ כִּדְמוּתֵנוּ (Genesis 1:26)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:40.159273098Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}